BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Open Source Event Calendar//Sample feed: categories and tags//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Neighbourhood Club
X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Berlin
X-WR-CALDESC:Sample feed for the category and tag import: CATEGORIES on one
  or several lines\, X-TAGS lists\, terms shared by events\, special characters.
BEGIN:VTIMEZONE
TZID:Europe/Berlin
X-LIC-LOCATION:Europe/Berlin
